  "sourceConflict": "The adopted 2026–2027 regulations Appendix F and current catalogue both reserve the second-year table for earlier entrants. Islam and Digital Humanities occur in both that table and the new first year, so reuse would double count. Article 4.2.1 confirms general course and thesis progression. The current third-year table and thesis entry provide context but do not resolve cohort applicability. A future-year API request returned identical annual product bytes.",
